<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Trading Architecture — Hermes Board</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  background: #020617;
  color: #e2e8f0;
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  padding: 40px;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}
.container { max-width: 1200px; width: 100%; }
.header {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
}
.header h1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9; }
.header .dot {
  width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: #34d399; animation: pulse 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0.4; }
}
.header .sub {
  font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 2px;
}
.diagram-card {
  background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #1e293b;
  border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 24px;
}
svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }

/* Summary cards */
.cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 0; }
.card {
  background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #1e293b;
  border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px;
}
.card-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.card-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }
.card-dot.cyan { background: #22d3ee; }
.card-dot.green { background: #34d399; }
.card-dot.violet { background: #a78bfa; }
.card h3 { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9; }
.card ul { list-style: none; }
.card li {
  font-size: 10px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.8;
  padding-left: 12px; position: relative;
}
.card li::before { content: "›"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #475569; }

/* Legend */
.legend { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; }
.legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 9px; color: #64748b; }
.legend-line { width: 24px; height: 2px; border-radius: 1px; }
.legend-line.solid { background: #34d399; }
.legend-line.dashed { background: transparent; border-top: 2px dashed #fbbf24; }
.legend-line.thin { background: #64748b; }
.legend-line.ai { background: #a78bfa; }
.legend-box {
  width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1.5px solid;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 6px; color: #94a3b8;
}
.legend-box.cyan { border-color: #22d3ee; background: rgba(8,51,68,0.4); }
.legend-box.green { border-color: #34d399; background: rgba(6,78,59,0.4); }
.legend-box.amber { border-color: #fbbf24; background: rgba(120,53,15,0.3); }
.legend-box.violet { border-color: #a78bfa; background: rgba(76,29,149,0.4); }
.legend-box.slate { border-color: #94a3b8; background: rgba(30,41,59,0.5); }

.footer {
  font-size: 9px; color: #334155; text-align: center;
  padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; margin-top: 24px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="dot"></div>
    <div>
      <h1>Strategy Vault → Hermes Board → Execution</h1>
      <div class="sub">Python-native pipeline · TV visualization · AI gate</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="diagram-card">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1100 740" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <!-- Background grid -->
      <defs>
        <pattern id="grid" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <path d="M 40 0 L 0 0 0 40" fill="none" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        </pattern>
        <marker id="arrow-green" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 Z" fill="#34d399"/>
        </marker>
        <marker id="arrow-cyan" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 Z" fill="#22d3ee"/>
        </marker>
        <marker id="arrow-amber" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 Z" fill="#fbbf24"/>
        </marker>
        <marker id="arrow-violet" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 Z" fill="#a78bfa"/>
        </marker>
      </defs>
      <rect width="1100" height="740" fill="url(#grid)"/>

      <!-- ===== SECTION 0: OBSIDIAN VAULT (top-right) ===== -->
      <rect x="780" y="20" width="280" height="80" rx="8" fill="rgba(30,41,59,0.5)" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="920" y="50" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="11" font-weight="600">STRATEGY VAULT</text>
      <text x="920" y="66" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Obsidian — curated notes &amp; strategy cards</text>
      <text x="920" y="82" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">Trader profiles · Setup rules · Chart examples</text>

      <!-- Arrow: Obsidian → Hermes Board -->
      <line x1="920" y1="100" x2="920" y2="130" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#arrow-amber)"/>
      <text x="930" y="118" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">user curates</text>

      <!-- ===== SECTION 1: DATA SOURCES ===== -->
      <rect x="30" y="20" width="700" height="90" rx="8" fill="rgba(120,53,15,0.3)" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4,4"/>
      <text x="380" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fbbf24" font-size="10" font-weight="600">EXTERNAL DATA SOURCES</text>

      <!-- Binance -->
      <rect x="50" y="52" width="160" height="44" rx="6" fill="rgba(30,41,59,0.5)" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="130" y="74" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10" font-weight="500">Binance API</text>
      <text x="130" y="88" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">OHLCV · Taker buy/sell</text>

      <!-- Coinalyze -->
      <rect x="250" y="52" width="160" height="44" rx="6" fill="rgba(30,41,59,0.5)" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="330" y="74" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10" font-weight="500">Coinalyze</text>
      <text x="330" y="88" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">OI · Funding · Liquidations</text>

      <!-- Yahoo / CoinGecko -->
      <rect x="450" y="52" width="160" height="44" rx="6" fill="rgba(30,41,59,0.5)" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="530" y="74" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10" font-weight="500">TradingView MCP</text>
      <text x="530" y="88" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">Prices · Techn · Sentiment</text>

      <!-- Arrow: Data → Python Engine -->
      <line x1="380" y1="110" x2="380" y2="150" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-amber)"/>
      <text x="390" y="134" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">streaming data</text>

      <!-- ===== SECTION 2: PYTHON ENGINE (Core) ===== -->
      <rect x="30" y="150" width="700" height="200" rx="10" fill="rgba(6,78,59,0.4)" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="380" y="172" text-anchor="middle" fill="#34d399" font-size="11" font-weight="600">PYTHON ENGINE (Core Layer) — Zero token cost</text>

      <!-- Data Fetcher -->
      <rect x="50" y="185" width="200" height="70" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="150" y="210" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10" font-weight="600">Data Fetcher</text>
      <text x="150" y="226" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Persistent 24/7 connection</text>
      <text x="150" y="240" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">Binance WS · Coinalyze REST</text>

      <!-- Monitor Loop -->
      <rect x="280" y="185" width="200" height="70" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="380" y="210" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10" font-weight="600">Monitor Loop</text>
      <text x="380" y="226" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Checks conditions every bar</text>
      <text x="380" y="240" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">MA · OI · CVD · Volume</text>

      <!-- Backtest Engine -->
      <rect x="510" y="185" width="200" height="70" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="610" y="210" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10" font-weight="600">Backtest Engine</text>
      <text x="610" y="226" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Historical simulation</text>
      <text x="610" y="240" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">TP targets · Regime analysis</text>

      <!-- Internal arrows -->
      <line x1="250" y1="220" x2="278" y2="220" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#arrow-green)"/>
      <line x1="480" y1="220" x2="508" y2="220" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#arrow-green)"/>

      <!-- Strategy Dev -->
      <rect x="50" y="270" width="660" height="40" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="380" y="288" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10" font-weight="500">Strategy Development</text>
      <text x="380" y="302" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Reads Obsidian strategy cards → implements in Python → validates via backtest</text>

      <!-- Arrow: Python Engine → Signal -->
      <line x1="380" y1="350" x2="380" y2="380" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-green)"/>
      <text x="390" y="369" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">signal + context</text>

      <!-- ===== SECTION 3: SIGNAL GENERATION ===== -->
      <rect x="130" y="380" width="500" height="50" rx="8" fill="rgba(8,51,68,0.4)" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="380" y="405" text-anchor="middle" fill="#22d3ee" font-size="11" font-weight="600">SIGNAL GENERATED</text>
      <text x="380" y="420" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Entry price · Direction · Conditions met · Suggested TP</text>

      <!-- Arrow: Signal → Hermes Gate -->
      <line x1="380" y1="430" x2="380" y2="465" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-cyan)"/>
      <text x="390" y="452" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">decision needed</text>

      <!-- ===== SECTION 4: HERMES GATE (AI) ===== -->
      <rect x="130" y="465" width="500" height="90" rx="10" fill="rgba(76,29,149,0.4)" stroke="#a78bfa" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="380" y="490" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a78bfa" font-size="11" font-weight="600">HERMES BOARD (AI Gate)</text>
      <text x="380" y="506" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c4b5fd" font-size="8">Reads context · Evaluates against rules · Makes decision</text>

      <!-- Three outcomes -->
      <rect x="155" y="518" width="140" height="28" rx="4" fill="rgba(6,78,59,0.3)" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="225" y="536" text-anchor="middle" fill="#34d399" font-size="8">PASS ✓</text>

      <rect x="310" y="518" width="140" height="28" rx="4" fill="rgba(76,29,149,0.3)" stroke="#a78bfa" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="380" y="536" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a78bfa" font-size="8">ADJUST TP</text>

      <rect x="465" y="518" width="140" height="28" rx="4" fill="rgba(136,19,55,0.3)" stroke="#fb7185" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="535" y="536" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fb7185" font-size="8">BLOCK ✕</text>

      <!-- Arrow: Hermes → Execution -->
      <line x1="380" y1="555" x2="380" y2="590" stroke="#a78bfa" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow-violet)"/>
      <text x="390" y="577" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">approved order</text>

      <!-- ===== SECTION 5: EXECUTION ===== -->
      <rect x="130" y="590" width="500" height="60" rx="8" fill="rgba(120,53,15,0.3)" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="380" y="615" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fbbf24" font-size="11" font-weight="600">EXECUTION LAYER</text>
      <text x="380" y="632" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">CCXT → Exchange  |  Webhook → Wundertrading / TradersPost</text>

      <!-- ===== RIGHT SIDE: UI LAYER ===== -->
      <!-- Arrow from Data to TV -->
      <line x1="730" y1="75" x2="860" y2="75" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
      <line x1="860" y1="75" x2="860" y2="370" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
      <line x1="860" y1="370" x2="900" y2="370" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,3" marker-end="url(#arrow-cyan)"/>

      <!-- TradingView -->
      <rect x="780" y="300" width="280" height="70" rx="8" fill="rgba(8,51,68,0.3)" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="920" y="328" text-anchor="middle" fill="#22d3ee" font-size="11" font-weight="600">TRADINGVIEW</text>
      <text x="920" y="344" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Visualization only — charts &amp; price display</text>
      <text x="920" y="358" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">No alerts · No execution dependency</text>

      <!-- ===== BOUNDARY BOX: Trusted Execution Zone ===== -->
      <rect x="15" y="140" width="1070" height="520" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="8,4" opacity="0.3"/>
      <text x="30" y="155" fill="#34d399" font-size="8" opacity="0.5">TRUSTED EXECUTION ZONE — Python controlled</text>

      <!-- Legend -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 680)">
        <text x="0" y="0" fill="#64748b" font-size="8">LEGEND</text>
        <rect x="0" y="10" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="rgba(120,53,15,0.3)" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="20" y="21" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">External / Data Source</text>
        
        <rect x="180" y="10" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="rgba(6,78,59,0.4)" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="200" y="21" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Python (computation)</text>
        
        <rect x="350" y="10" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="rgba(76,29,149,0.4)" stroke="#a78bfa" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="370" y="21" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Hermes AI (decision)</text>

        <rect x="520" y="10" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="rgba(8,51,68,0.4)" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="540" y="21" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">TradingView (display)</text>

        <rect x="700" y="10" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="rgba(30,41,59,0.5)" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="720" y="21" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Obsidian (storage)</text>

        <line x1="0" y1="36" x2="24" y2="36" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
        <text x="30" y="40" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">Data read</text>

        <line x1="120" y1="36" x2="144" y2="36" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="150" y="40" fill="#64748b" font-size="7">Data flow</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <!-- Summary Cards -->
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="card-dot green"></div>
        <h3>Python Engine</h3>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>Persistent data fetcher — 24/7 market data stream</li>
        <li>Monitor loop — checks conditions every bar</li>
        <li>Backtest engine — historical sims, TP targets</li>
        <li>Strategy dev — reads Obsidian, implements in Python</li>
        <li>Zero token cost — all pure computation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="card-dot violet"></div>
        <h3>Hermes Board</h3>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>AI gate between signal and execution</li>
        <li>Evaluates signal against rules &amp; live context</li>
        <li>Three outcomes: pass / adjust TP / block</li>
        <li>Only fires when Python calls it</li>
        <li>Token-efficient — decision-only, no monitoring</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="card-dot cyan"></div>
        <h3>Strategy Vault (Obsidian)</h3>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>Source of truth for all strategy knowledge</li>
        <li>User curates — notes, charts, setup rules</li>
        <li>Hermes reads to build strategy cards</li>
        <li>Python reads to implement &amp; backtest</li>
        <li>Tag system for clean/original attribution</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="legend">
    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-line solid"></div>Data flow</div>
    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-line dashed"></div>Boundary / security</div>
    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-line thin"></div>Read only</div>
    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-line ai"></div>AI decision flow</div>
    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-box green"></div>Python</div>
    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-box violet"></div>Hermes AI</div>
    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-box amber"></div>External</div>
    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-box cyan"></div>Display</div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    Strategy Vault → Hermes Board — Architecture v1.0 · Python-native trading pipeline
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
